  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 - Equalities Programming in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, FCDO Yemen will partner with the private sector, civil society, and other international donors to create collaborative spaces, referred to as Social Innovation Labs (SILs). SILs will bring relevant stakeholders together to co-design solutions for challenges hindering women&apos;s inclusion and women economic empowerment in the agriculture sector. Alongside establishing stakeholder dialogue and capacity building opportunities, this project will also create the enabling ecosystems for the development of innovative solutions tackling challenges on gender equality and women&apos;s economic empowerment in the agriculture sector.</narrative>
  </description>
